---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | 17th Street Labs"
  description="Meet the founders and operating principles behind 17th Street Labs, an independent AI engineering and security research consultancy."
>
  <section class="interior-hero about-hero">
    <div class="section-label">
      <span>01</span> THE LAB
    </div>
    <h1>
      Experience without
      <br />
      <em>the institution.</em>
    </h1>
    <p>
      17th Street Labs is a founder-led AI engineering and security research
      consultancy. Small by design, direct by default, and built for work where
      judgment matters.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="numbers">
    <div>
      <b>25+</b>
      <span>years building and leading software systems</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <b>6→60</b>
      <span>engineers scaled in a prior platform organization</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <b>250k/s</b>
      <span>events delivered at production scale</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <b>50M</b>
      <span>users reached by a platform Dan helped build</span>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="principles-section">
    <div class="section-label">
      <span>02</span> OPERATING PRINCIPLES
    </div>
    <div class="principle-stack">
      <div>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Evidence over theater.</h3>
        <p>
          A fluent demo is not a reliable system. We design measurement that can
          survive scrutiny.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Security is architecture.</h3>
        <p>
          Permissions, boundaries, data flows, and failure recovery belong in
          the design, not the launch checklist.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Capability must transfer.</h3>
        <p>
          The engagement compounds when your team leaves with sharper systems
          and stronger judgment.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="founders">
    <div class="section-label">
      <span>03</span> FOUNDERS
    </div>
    <div class="founder-grid">
      <article class="spotlight-card">
        <div class="founder-monogram marina">ML</div>
        <span class="micro">CO-FOUNDER · CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER</span>
        <h2>Marina Levy</h2>
        <p>
          Marina sets the operating direction for 17th Street Labs, shaping
          ambitious technical work into focused engagements, durable
          partnerships, and measurable client value.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="spotlight-card">
        <div class="founder-monogram">DL</div>
        <span class="micro">CO-FOUNDER · PRINCIPAL AI ENGINEER</span>
        <h2>Dan Levy</h2>
        <p>
          Engineer, educator, founder, and technical leader with 25+ years
          across production systems, developer platforms, AI applications,
          evaluation infrastructure, and offensive and defensive AI security.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:dan@danlevy.net">
          dan@danlevy.net <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={15} />
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
